	-- {item:277246} Ruby-Adorned Blade · {area:796} Scarlet Monastery · {quest:78307} The Horn of Xelthos
	-- was: ["The {item:277246}, C's payment for a solo job in the {area:796}, after The {item:210183}."] = "Die {item:277246}, die Bezahlung von C für einen Soloauftrag im {area:796}, nach dem {item:210183}."
	["The {item:277246}, C's payment for a solo job in the {area:796}, after {quest:78307}."] = "{quest:78307} görevinden sonra, {area:796} içindeki tek kişilik bir iş için C'nin ödemesi {item:277246}.",

	-- Step 1: C's dead drop
	["C's dead drop"] = "C'nin gizli teslim noktası",
	-- {quest:78307} The Horn of Xelthos · {object:410369} Dead Drop · {area:204} Pyrewood Village · {area:236} Shadowfang Keep
	-- was: ["C's next job comes by letter: once you are level 30 and have done the horn job (The {item:210183}, its payment from this {object:410369} handed in), visit any capital city and C's letter arrives in the mailbox; only then does the {object:410369} near {area:204}, in southern Silverpine just south of {area:236}, offer it. The quest data lists a minimum of 25, but players get the letter, and the job, at 30."] = "Der nächste Auftrag von C kommt per Brief: Sobald du Stufe 30 hast und den Horn-Auftrag erledigt hast ({item:210183}, die Bezahlung bei diesem {object:410369} abgegeben), besuche eine beliebige Hauptstadt, und der Brief von C landet im Briefkasten; erst dann bietet ihn der {object:410369} nahe {area:204} an, im südlichen Silberwald direkt südlich von {area:236}. Die Questdaten nennen eine Mindeststufe von 25, aber Spieler erhalten den Brief und den Auftrag mit 30."
	["C's next job comes by letter: once you are level 30 and have done the horn job ({quest:78307}, its payment from this {object:410369} handed in), visit any capital city and C's letter arrives in the mailbox; only then does the {object:410369} near {area:204}, in southern Silverpine just south of {area:236}, offer it. The quest data lists a minimum of 25, but players get the letter, and the job, at 30."] = "C'nin bir sonraki işi mektupla gelir: 30. seviyeye ulaşıp boynuz işini ({quest:78307}, ödemesi bu {object:410369} noktasından teslim alınmış) bitirince herhangi bir başkenti ziyaret et, C'nin mektubu posta kutusuna gelir. Ancak ondan sonra güney Silverpine'da, {area:236} kalesinin hemen güneyinde, {area:204} yakınındaki {object:410369} işi sunar. Görev verisi en az 25 diyor, ama oyuncular mektubu ve işi 30'da alıyor.",

	-- Step 2: The Scarlet Monastery
	-- {area:796} Scarlet Monastery
	["The {area:796}"] = "{area:796}",
	-- {zone:1420} Tirisfal Glades · {item:210955} Scarlet Initiate's Uniform · {object:412147} Supply Locker (no name in this language: may be words) · {spell:921} Pick Pocket · {npc:4293} Scarlet Scryer · {item:210963} Scryer's Key · {object:412759} Personal Letterbox (no name in this language: may be words) · {item:210967} Confidential Message · {item:210968} Reliquary Key
	-- was: ["The monastery stands in the far north-east of {zone:1420}. Go in alone, out of any group. Before entering, take the {item:210955} from the {object:412147} in the stables behind the monastery and wear it; stealth and suspicious actions remove it, so put it back on after each wing change. In the Graveyard, in the Chamber of Atonement (the first big room), {spell:921} a {npc:4293} or Scarlet Crier for the {item:210963}. In the Library, open the Personal Letterbox in the Athenaeum with it and read the {item:210967}. It sends you back to sit on both benches between the two statues in the Graveyard. Watch for the mechanism's messages, then take the {item:210968} from the stone coffer: an elite stands by the coffer with a patrol behind it, but from beside the northern mausoleum you can turn the camera until the box shows and click it through the wall (an interact key works too). An elite ghost walks near the mausoleum; the broken piece at its edge keeps you out of its path. Then return to the Library for the locked reliquary and the eye. Avoid fighting through the instance."] = "Das Kloster liegt im äußersten Nordosten von {zone:1420}. Geh allein hinein, außerhalb jeder Gruppe. Nimm vor dem Betreten {item:210955} aus {object:412147} in den Ställen hinter dem Kloster und zieh sie an; Verstohlenheit und verdächtige Handlungen entfernen sie, also zieh sie nach jedem Flügelwechsel wieder an. Wende im Friedhof, in der Chamber of Atonement (dem ersten großen Raum), {spell:921} auf einen {npc:4293} oder Scarlet Crier an, um {item:210963} zu bekommen. Öffne in der Bibliothek damit den Personal Letterbox im Athenaeum und lies {item:210967}. Sie schickt dich zurück, um dich im Friedhof auf beide Bänke zwischen den beiden Statuen zu setzen. Achte auf die Meldungen des Mechanismus und nimm dann {item:210968} aus dem Stone Coffer: Ein Elite steht beim Coffer mit einer Patrouille dahinter, aber von neben dem nördlichen Mausoleum aus kannst du die Kamera drehen, bis die Kiste sichtbar ist, und sie durch die Wand anklicken (eine Interaktionstaste funktioniert auch). Ein Elite-Geist läuft nahe dem Mausoleum; das zerbrochene Stück an seinem Rand hält dich aus seinem Weg. Kehre dann in die Bibliothek zurück zum verschlossenen Reliquiar und dem Auge. Vermeide es, dich durch die Instanz zu kämpfen."
	["The monastery stands in the far north-east of {zone:1420}. Go in alone, out of any group. Before entering, take the {item:210955} from the {object:412147} in the stables behind the monastery and wear it; stealth and suspicious actions remove it, so put it back on after each wing change. In the Graveyard, in the Chamber of Atonement (the first big room), {spell:921} a {npc:4293} or Scarlet Crier for the {item:210963}. In the Library, open the {object:412759} in the Athenaeum with it and read the {item:210967}. It sends you back to sit on both benches between the two statues in the Graveyard. Watch for the mechanism's messages, then take the {item:210968} from the stone coffer: an elite stands by the coffer with a patrol behind it, but from beside the northern mausoleum you can turn the camera until the box shows and click it through the wall (an interact key works too). An elite ghost walks near the mausoleum; the broken piece at its edge keeps you out of its path. Then return to the Library for the locked reliquary and the eye. Avoid fighting through the instance."] = "Manastır {zone:1420} bölgesinin en kuzeydoğusunda duruyor. Yalnız, herhangi bir grubun dışında gir. Girmeden önce manastırın arkasındaki ahırlarda {object:412147} içinden {item:210955} alıp giy. Gizlilik ve şüpheli hareketler onu çıkarır, yani her kanat değişiminden sonra yeniden giy. Graveyard'da, Chamber of Atonement'ta (ilk büyük oda) {item:210963} için bir {npc:4293} ya da Scarlet Crier yaratığına {spell:921} yap. Library'de onunla Athenaeum'daki {object:412759} kutusunu açıp {item:210967} mektubunu oku. Seni Graveyard'da iki heykelin arasındaki iki bankın ikisine de oturman için geri yollar. Mekanizmanın mesajlarını izle, sonra taş sandıktan {item:210968} anahtarını al: sandığın yanında bir elit, arkasında da bir devriye duruyor, ama kuzey türbenin yanından kamerayı kutu görünene kadar çevirip duvarın içinden ona tıklayabilirsin (bir etkileşim tuşu da işe yarar). Türbenin yakınında elit bir hayalet yürüyor. Kenarındaki kırık parça seni onun yolundan uzak tutar. Sonra kilitli emanet sandığı ve göz için Library'ye dön. Zindanda dövüşerek ilerlemekten kaçın.",
	["Solo route: Graveyard key, Library letter, Graveyard benches and coffer, then Library reliquary for the eye. Read the letter before the bench puzzle; check the disguise each time you change wings."] = "Tek başına rota: Graveyard anahtarı, Library mektubu, Graveyard bankları ve sandığı, sonra göz için Library emanet sandığı. Bank bulmacasından önce mektubu oku. Her kanat değiştirdiğinde kılığını kontrol et.",
	["the locked reliquary in the Library"] = "Library'deki kilitli emanet sandığı",

